{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14232470","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14232470","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1423247001:0":{"text":"Helthor's beard! How could this possibly happen?!","source_cn":"赫托在下！怎么会发生这种事？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF386712542E314DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1423247001":{"text":"Helthor's beard! How could this possibly happen?!","source_cn":"赫托在下！怎么会发生这种事？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF386712542E314DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423247002:0":{"text":"The amount of ore in the mine doesn't quite add up lately, with many gone missing. I thought someone's been stealing it...","source_cn":"最近矿洞里采好的矿石数量对不上，少了很多，我以为是有偷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8C81E671AC5DCDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423247003:0":{"text":"But what I just saw proved me wrong. The ore, and even my toolkit, were scurrying around like they had a mind of their own!","source_cn":"可是刚刚，我亲眼看见矿石、包括装着矿石的工具包都在地上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7536E6F6B934E8AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423247004:0":{"text":"I couldn't believe my eyes!","source_cn":"天哪，我不是在做梦吧！","status":"match